* 3D mode 7 for rigid die 1 (moving data = its DIEGEO surface, mesh nodes transformed by the wrapper) lifted 5 and dropped along -z onto the workpiece
* ORACLE: 'Object 1 has been dropped successfully.', but the die (centre of mass over (15,18), outside the 12 x 15 workpiece top) tips over the workpiece edge and falls past everything until the iteration limit: final die 1 box x 84.0..134.7, y -59.1..-7.3, z -174.6..-122.1 (DIEGEO and mesh nodes identical). Reaching the limit is not an error (OBJPOS_drop_solver.md 1); not reproducible without a full port.
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 0 0 5
OBJPOS 1 7 0.002 0 0 -1 0 0 0 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
